{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VOID SOUL - Artbook Vol.1</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 70-page artbook featuring character profiles, poster illustrations, early design concepts, and rough sketches, along with developer comments and a special Q&amp;A section.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VOID SOUL - Artbook Vol.2</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 70-page artbook showcasing character profiles, poster illustrations, early drafts, and rough sketches from the side-story DLC and the PC version. It also includes developer talks\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >originally shared on social media, a newly written director\u2019s message, and a sneak peek at upcoming DLC content planned for the PC version.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can access the artbooks in your Steam Library by right-clicking the game title \u2192 Properties \u2192 Installed Files \u2192 Browse Local Files.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Language Support &amp; Spoiler Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both Vol.1 and Vol.2 are available in Korean only. As they contain spoilers, we recommend reading them after fully experiencing the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991130?t=1757469146","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3991130?t=1757469146","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991130/2b9cd89476b168dd4857c06a00c26e19c0835004/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757469146","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991130/2b9cd89476b168dd4857c06a00c26e19c0835004/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757469146","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_